{"id":"9ef82b54a29317e0","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-solovay-difference.md","title":"Solovay Reducibility by a Left-c.e. Difference","display":"thm-solovay-difference — Solovay Reducibility by a Left-c.e. Difference","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-solovay-difference","aliases":["43-thm-solovay-difference"],"display":"thm-solovay-difference — Solovay Reducibility by a Left-c.e. Difference","depends_on":["[[43-df-solovay-red]]","[[43-df-leftcomputable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 13.2.6","source_printed_pages":"342–343","source_pdf_pages":"362–363","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-solovay-difference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-solovay-difference</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-difference — Solovay Reducibility by a Left-c.e. Difference"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7d00f16a112ff92\" href=\"?note=e7d00f16a112ff92\" title=\"43-df-leftcomputable\">43-df-leftcomputable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 13.2.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"342–343"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"362–363"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\gamma)\\land c\\beta=\\alpha+\\gamma\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb Q_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\gamma)\\land c\\beta=\\alpha+\\gamma\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>比例常数固定为正有理数；差值为左 c.e. 是归约的有效内容，不能只要求差值作为实数存在。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 13.2.6；印刷页 342–343，PDF 页 362–363。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-leftcomputable","status":"resolved","id":"e7d00f16a112ff92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-leftcomputable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\le_S$ 见 [[43-df-solovay-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\le_S\\beta\\leftrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\mathbb Q_{>0}\\;\\exists\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\gamma)\\land c\\beta=\\alpha+\\gamma\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1371,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-difference]] — Solovay Reducibility by a Left-c.e. Difference"},{"id":"88898ebf913a1fd0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]，差分刻画见 [[43-thm-solovay-difference]]，左 c.e. 加法闭包见 [[43-thm-left-ce-arithmetic]]。"}],"outgoing":["a566c9610179ba40","e7d00f16a112ff92"]}